{"name":"cyclic_four_block_bounds","v":1,"source_hash":"37091cb7d9181afc","lines":["m : ℕ","e : Fin (2 * m + 5) × Fin 6","⊢ cyclic_four_block_src m e < 4 * (2 * m + 5) ∧ cyclic_four_block_dst m e < 4 * (2 * m + 5)","i : Fin (2 * m + 5)","j : Fin 6","⊢ cyclic_four_block_src m (i, j) < 4 * (2 * m + 5) ∧ cyclic_four_block_dst m (i, j) < 4 * (2 * m + 5)","case «0»","⊢ cyclic_four_block_src m (i, (fun i => i) ⟨0, ⋯⟩) < 4 * (2 * m + 5) ∧","    cyclic_four_block_dst m (i, (fun i => i) ⟨0, ⋯⟩) < 4 * (2 * m + 5)","case «1»","⊢ cyclic_four_block_src m (i, (fun i => i) ⟨1, ⋯⟩) < 4 * (2 * m + 5) ∧","    cyclic_four_block_dst m (i, (fun i => i) ⟨1, ⋯⟩) < 4 * (2 * m + 5)","case «2»","⊢ cyclic_four_block_src m (i, (fun i => i) ⟨2, ⋯⟩) < 4 * (2 * m + 5) ∧","    cyclic_four_block_dst m (i, (fun i => i) ⟨2, ⋯⟩) < 4 * (2 * m + 5)","case «3»","⊢ cyclic_four_block_src m (i, (fun i => i) ⟨3, ⋯⟩) < 4 * (2 * m + 5) ∧","    cyclic_four_block_dst m (i, (fun i => i) ⟨3, ⋯⟩) < 4 * (2 * m + 5)","case «4»","⊢ cyclic_four_block_src m (i, (fun i => i) ⟨4, ⋯⟩) < 4 * (2 * m + 5) ∧","    cyclic_four_block_dst m (i, (fun i => i) ⟨4, ⋯⟩) < 4 * (2 * m + 5)","case «5»","⊢ cyclic_four_block_src m (i, (fun i => i) ⟨5, ⋯⟩) < 4 * (2 * m + 5) ∧","    cyclic_four_block_dst m (i, (fun i => i) ⟨5, ⋯⟩) < 4 * (2 * m + 5)","⊢ 4 * ↑i < 4 * (2 * m + 5) ∧ 4 * ↑i + 1 < 4 * (2 * m + 5)","⊢ 4 * ↑i < 4 * (2 * m + 5) ∧ 4 * ↑i + 2 < 4 * (2 * m + 5)","⊢ 4 * ↑i < 4 * (2 * m + 5) ∧ 4 * ↑i + 3 < 4 * (2 * m + 5)","⊢ 4 * ↑i + 1 < 4 * (2 * m + 5) ∧ (4 * if ↑i + 1 < 2 * m + 5 then ↑i + 1 else 0) + 1 < 4 * (2 * m + 5)","⊢ 4 * ↑i + 2 < 4 * (2 * m + 5) ∧ (if ↑i + 1 = 2 * m + 5 then 3 else 4 * (↑i + 1) + 2) < 4 * (2 * m + 5)","⊢ 4 * ↑i + 3 < 4 * (2 * m + 5) ∧ (if ↑i + 1 = 2 * m + 5 then 2 else 4 * (↑i + 1) + 3) < 4 * (2 * m + 5)"],"goals":[[0,1,2],[0,3,4,5],[6,0,3,7,8],[9,0,3,10,11],[12,0,3,13,14],[15,0,3,16,17],[18,0,3,19,20],[21,0,3,22,23],[6,0,3,24],[9,0,3,25],[12,0,3,26],[15,0,3,27],[18,0,3,28],[21,0,3,29]],"steps":[{"line":3,"col"